<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style=""><font face="arial" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Attach a client contact sheet</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Hello <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">[Client Contact</span>],<br><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">I'd like to take this opportunity to make you aware of changes to your Insperity service team. We are realigning resources to better meet your needs as a part of our effort to continue to provide extraordinary service. I am excited to introduce myself as your dedicated HR Specialist and client liaison; you can reach me at <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">xxx-xxx-xxxx</span> and <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">name@insperity.com</span>.<br><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">If this is a transition from one BT HRS to another in the same team</span>:</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[Your Payroll Team, and Manager, HR Services are unchanged.</span>]</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">If this is a transition from one Business team to another</span>:&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[Your payroll team is unchanged; the new Manager, HR Services is [&nbsp; ]</span>&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br>I have attached your Insperity Service Team contact sheet for your convenience.</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Note also that I work in a team environment; if I am unavailable and you require urgent assistance, please reach out to one&nbsp; of my colleagues by emailing our team at&nbsp; <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">team@insperity.com</span> or via the team line at <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">xxx-xxx-xxxx</span>.&nbsp;<br><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">I would like to schedule a call to discuss your company's needs and the HR solutions that Insperity can continue to provide to your business. I am available on [<span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">dates available]</span>. Please let me know if one of these dates will work for you or suggest an alternate time.&nbsp;<br><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">We thank you for your continued business; I look forward to our partnership.&nbsp;<br><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">With regards,&nbsp;</font></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>